WEBVTT

00:04.130 --> 00:08.130
You can sleep over with us, Ai-chan.
I'll bake us something fun!

00:08.130 --> 00:08.880
Huh?

00:08.880 --> 00:11.880
What do you like to eat? I take requests!

00:12.580 --> 00:14.960
I love anything with chocolate!

00:15.170 --> 00:18.460
Okay, we could do a chocolate cake, or some brownies!

00:18.580 --> 00:19.960
For real?!

00:19.960 --> 00:20.630
Wait a sec.

00:22.210 --> 00:25.960
There's a reason you don't eat dessert at night...

00:29.670 --> 00:31.750
I'm gonna use the bathroom before we go.

00:31.750 --> 00:35.630
Do it fast, Keitaro, before the bigger baddies show up.

00:41.630 --> 00:44.580
I think... they're already here!

00:47.830 --> 00:51.880
If I can pretend I don't see it, I should be fine...

02:42.170 --> 02:43.130
I feel it.

02:44.630 --> 02:46.040
It's following me.

02:50.290 --> 02:51.460
Don't freak out!

02:57.130 --> 02:58.790
If we skip breakfast tomorrow...

02:59.210 --> 03:01.670
...we should be totally fine to snack tonight!

03:06.290 --> 03:10.000
What the hell was that thing I just saw?

03:11.080 --> 03:12.040
Is it still here?

03:18.500 --> 03:20.960
Wh-what is it doing to me?!

03:21.880 --> 03:23.710
It's trying to pull on something...

03:24.670 --> 03:27.170
But what?!

03:30.460 --> 03:33.210
Is it touching... my brainstem?!

03:35.580 --> 03:38.500
If Yayoi-chan's dolls weren't protecting me...

03:40.170 --> 03:42.000
...I'd be dead!

03:47.170 --> 03:52.250
If it turned invisible so it could get close to me
and mess with my brain...

03:52.830 --> 03:56.080
And it did all that intentionally...

03:57.420 --> 03:58.500
We are so screwed!

03:59.790 --> 04:01.040
Sorry that took so long!

04:01.920 --> 04:05.040
Hurry! Let's get outta here!

04:05.330 --> 04:06.330
Why's he...

04:05.330 --> 04:10.250
C'mon, I thought we were in a hurry! Let's go!

04:06.580 --> 04:07.790
...so freaked out?

04:13.630 --> 04:14.420
Keitaro.

04:15.210 --> 04:17.710
What did that thing back there do?

04:19.330 --> 04:25.960
I couldn't sense it that strongly,
but... it tried to tear out my brainstem.

04:26.790 --> 04:30.710
Ai-chan only has one doll protecting her.
If it goes after her...

04:31.330 --> 04:32.420
She'd be in trouble.

04:35.790 --> 04:38.040
<b>CONSTRUCTION AHEAD</b>

04:35.790 --> 04:38.040
<b>USE ALTERNATE ROUTE</b>

04:36.330 --> 04:37.790
The stairs are blocked off.

04:38.080 --> 04:41.130
Wait, why even take the stairs? My legs'll just get tired.

04:41.130 --> 04:43.920
They make it easier to escape if we're in trouble out here.

04:43.920 --> 04:45.580
Oh, huh.

04:45.670 --> 04:48.920
You're pretty smart, Little Senpai! You think of everything, huh?

04:46.170 --> 04:48.920
Is something coming after us?

04:50.130 --> 04:51.290
Everyone in?

04:51.290 --> 04:52.210
Mm-hmm!

04:52.330 --> 04:53.500
<b>CLOSE</b>

04:52.330 --> 04:53.500
<b>OPEN</b>

04:55.630 --> 04:56.130
<b>CLOSE</b>

04:55.630 --> 04:57.630
<b>OPEN</b>

04:56.130 --> 04:57.830
C'mon, c'mon!

04:57.830 --> 04:58.750
Sensei!

05:27.420 --> 05:28.330
I don't see it...

05:38.040 --> 05:39.420
Did we get away?

06:13.630 --> 06:17.170
I hate how my situation drags other people into it, too...

06:17.750 --> 06:22.290
The entity around Ai draws spirits in,
then turns them on others around her?

06:31.790 --> 06:32.710
Ai-chan!

06:35.750 --> 06:36.710
Kei-kun!

06:36.880 --> 06:37.790
Eiko!

06:54.040 --> 06:55.960
I'm sorry... Thank you!

07:18.960 --> 07:20.000
Not again...

07:24.460 --> 07:25.290
Ai...

07:26.000 --> 07:29.830
...your presence here is bringing misfortune to this family.

07:30.630 --> 07:33.210
I'm sorry, but you need to leave.

07:36.210 --> 07:38.580
Our family sure is complicated, huh?

07:39.460 --> 07:43.500
I'm living alone while I look for a job.
Wanna crash at my place?

07:52.080 --> 07:54.880
I'm the one the spirits want.

07:55.830 --> 07:59.960
But instead of me, they took away Sensei.

08:01.210 --> 08:02.170
Not again...

08:04.460 --> 08:06.830
Sensei! Sensei!

08:06.080 --> 08:06.830
Ai-chan!

08:14.130 --> 08:18.710
Kei-kun's gonna be okay. He's got Yayoi-chan with him.

08:20.080 --> 08:21.420
They've got this.

08:23.040 --> 08:25.460
<b>CLOSE</b>

08:23.040 --> 08:25.460
<b>OPEN</b>

08:23.380 --> 08:25.290
Open up! C'mon, open!

08:31.380 --> 08:32.960
Wait, this building...

08:33.790 --> 08:35.670
doesn't HAVE a basement...

08:34.130 --> 08:35.960
<b>OPEN</b>

08:34.130 --> 08:35.960
<b>CLOSE</b>

08:35.960 --> 08:37.960
<b>OPEN</b>

09:12.130 --> 09:15.420
Why did you bring us down here?

09:18.330 --> 09:20.670
You mean, besides killing us?

09:21.040 --> 09:23.330
This is way too much effort to just kill us.

09:35.750 --> 09:38.670
Are those... brains?

09:46.460 --> 09:47.630
More ghosts?!

09:49.000 --> 09:50.000
It brought friends?!

09:56.210 --> 09:58.210
It hurts! Stop!

10:06.210 --> 10:08.710
I'll do whatever you want...

10:09.250 --> 10:10.210
Huh?

10:17.540 --> 10:20.460
Are these her memories?

10:22.170 --> 10:24.040
Open up! Open up!

10:24.420 --> 10:26.630
Wait, why aren't there any buttons?!

10:27.170 --> 10:29.750
Please, open the doors! C'mon!

10:50.170 --> 10:53.540
Was that how she died?

10:54.170 --> 10:58.790
And that's what it's trying to do to us now...

10:59.920 --> 11:03.040
Yayoi-chan, these spirits are its previous victims!

11:03.580 --> 11:06.960
It's not even letting them rest after it kills them!

11:07.920 --> 11:10.790
It's forcing them to serve him,

11:11.080 --> 11:16.080
and they're going to shove us out to trap us with him
so he can mess with our brains!

11:16.830 --> 11:19.250
We can't step out of this elevator!

11:21.250 --> 11:23.710
Then we'll just have to force him to come to us.

11:24.630 --> 11:26.670
This one can take him, easy.

11:27.790 --> 11:34.580
Then he'll be weak enough for the elevator
to start working, and we can get out of here.

11:35.290 --> 11:39.880
To beat him, we need to be the ones who trap him.

11:40.580 --> 11:43.960
Okay, but we still can't go out there, so how?!

11:44.500 --> 11:45.290
We'll use this.

11:46.790 --> 11:50.790
This one's got lots of potential.
It's gonna be real strong one day.

11:53.170 --> 11:55.630
It'll keep you safe for now.

11:56.290 --> 12:00.130
But don't leave the elevator. You know what to do, right?

12:00.130 --> 12:00.790
Huh?

12:01.710 --> 12:03.710
Okay. Let's put this plan into motion.

12:04.580 --> 12:06.250
Y-you just said don't leave!

12:07.210 --> 12:11.290
And wait, what plan?
You didn't say anything about a plan!

12:13.920 --> 12:14.330
No.

12:14.790 --> 12:16.880
She wants me to back her up.

12:18.000 --> 12:20.540
She's trusting me while she takes this huge risk...

12:21.130 --> 12:22.960
It was only going after Keitaro.

12:23.460 --> 12:26.830
The possibility it'll only trap me down here
is extremely low.

12:27.630 --> 12:31.630
It's got me, but it won't be happy unless it has both of us.

12:32.420 --> 12:34.790
But it's underestimated me...

12:35.580 --> 12:36.630
...because I'm a child.

12:51.290 --> 12:52.000
Keitaro!

12:56.630 --> 12:57.920
You were too focused on me.

12:59.290 --> 13:01.080
You should've watched your feet.

13:01.830 --> 13:04.250
You were totally convinced you were in control,
which left you open.

13:05.250 --> 13:07.000
This rope can interact with spirits.

13:07.750 --> 13:10.540
It's excellent for catching you off-guard.

13:26.210 --> 13:32.210
This one took damage when you messed
with Keitaro earlier. He's real angry.

13:39.540 --> 13:40.580
Stop struggling.

13:41.250 --> 13:42.210
Time to pay.

14:08.580 --> 14:13.960
<b>OPEN      CLOSE</b>

14:09.000 --> 14:12.580
That should be enough to weaken him
and get things working again.

14:14.960 --> 14:15.670
It's working!

14:16.920 --> 14:18.920
Third floor? They're on the first, though...

14:20.170 --> 14:23.330
I want to take care of the ghost problem
in Ai's apartment.

14:27.750 --> 14:29.130
Yayoi-chan...

14:29.130 --> 14:30.000
This will make it better.

14:31.670 --> 14:35.580
Unless we help them,
they'll just turn into evil spirits themselves.

14:36.250 --> 14:37.250
So they're coming with us.

14:42.500 --> 14:45.040
We're okay. Back in a sec.

14:45.040 --> 14:45.960
How are you so fast?!

14:46.500 --> 14:48.500
<b>KAMIYO</b>

14:52.250 --> 14:55.460
Yayoi-chan, how's this going to help?

14:56.830 --> 15:00.080
Do you know what they used
as a scarecrow back in the day?

15:00.540 --> 15:02.000
N-no, I don't...

15:02.460 --> 15:06.330
They'd put up a dead crow
as a warning to scare the others away.

15:07.580 --> 15:09.500
This is the ghost version of that.

15:12.170 --> 15:18.420
These spirits will keep at it
until their regrets and anger is resolved.

15:19.710 --> 15:25.960
And with Ai living here,
the god's aura will heal him little by little.

15:27.130 --> 15:30.540
Every time he heals, they'll tear him open again.

15:31.250 --> 15:36.420
Who knows how many years it'll take
for them to be at peace.

15:37.330 --> 15:40.330
How many decades, even.

15:41.500 --> 15:47.420
Here it will stay, tortured, unable to escape,
scaring away other spirits forever.

15:48.540 --> 15:52.960
Not unlike Sañjiva, the hell where souls
are endlessly ripped apart and revived.

15:56.790 --> 16:02.790
Eventually, when those four spirits pass on,
I'll come back to devour him.

16:03.460 --> 16:06.830
I say this a lot, but boy, am I glad she's on my side...

16:07.460 --> 16:10.830
We'll need to do some more work
to help guide the spirits in and out of here.

16:11.380 --> 16:14.000
Let's go home and get the tools we need.

16:21.710 --> 16:23.380
Eiko! Ai-chan!

16:23.540 --> 16:25.500
Kei-kun, Yayoi-chan!

16:29.790 --> 16:33.080
You're okay!

16:35.210 --> 16:37.380
Yep. Let's go, Ai.

16:40.960 --> 16:42.830
I can't.

16:43.000 --> 16:43.630
Huh?

16:44.670 --> 16:51.000
It's my fault you guys got tangled up in this.
I'm just gonna drag you into something else.

16:51.670 --> 16:52.710
And if that happens...

16:53.790 --> 16:55.880
I won't forgive myself for losing them.

16:57.330 --> 17:00.040
You're all so nice and awesome...

17:00.460 --> 17:02.040
I don't want you to start hating me.

17:02.040 --> 17:03.290
Ai-chan...

17:04.170 --> 17:07.580
It's okay. I'll be fine.

17:08.250 --> 17:10.500
I'll be fine, okay?

17:16.420 --> 17:21.210
I'm your tutor, Ai-chan.
I can't just walk away when you need help.

17:21.580 --> 17:22.750
Sensei!

17:26.040 --> 17:28.540
You can't, you could get hurt...

17:29.210 --> 17:32.250
Ai, we caught that spirit.

17:32.830 --> 17:33.580
Okay.

17:34.000 --> 17:35.880
We put it in your apartment.

17:36.080 --> 17:36.670
Okay.

17:37.580 --> 17:38.290
What?!

17:38.290 --> 17:39.420
It's not what you think!

17:39.420 --> 17:45.710
We're using it to scare away other baddies, and, uh...

17:42.040 --> 17:43.420
It's proof of my promise.

17:44.750 --> 17:48.540
No matter what misfortune you might attract, I promise...

17:49.170 --> 17:51.670
We promise to take care of it!

17:53.170 --> 17:55.000
And we won't let it get close to you!

17:55.540 --> 17:58.580
You called me Little Senpai, right?

17:59.710 --> 18:01.330
So, listen to your Senpai.

18:01.920 --> 18:03.580
Come with me.

18:07.170 --> 18:08.080
Okay!

18:10.670 --> 18:16.500
Thank you! Thank you so much!

18:23.170 --> 18:27.960
Big Brother, I'll be okay.
I've got friends who'll stick with me.

18:28.880 --> 18:31.330
What you did still hurts, but...

18:32.290 --> 18:34.420
I'm done moping about it.

18:35.540 --> 18:36.290
Sensei!

18:37.420 --> 18:42.170
You said my brother must've had a reason
for doing what he did, right?

18:42.670 --> 18:43.380
Yeah.

18:44.290 --> 18:47.670
Then I'm gonna figure that reason out.

18:48.330 --> 18:50.830
And I'll accept the truth, no matter what it is.

18:51.330 --> 18:55.130
So keep your eyes on me, yeah?

18:57.000 --> 18:57.830
You got it.

18:59.750 --> 19:01.670
She's making plans...

19:03.130 --> 19:06.170
I'm really glad to hear she's picking herself back up
after what happened.

19:06.790 --> 19:09.710
But unless she escapes the clutches of this god...

19:10.830 --> 19:13.210
When I turn twenty, it's gonna take me away.

19:15.080 --> 19:16.210
How can we help?

19:23.500 --> 19:25.170
You guys go ahead!

19:32.420 --> 19:33.380
What the hell...?

19:34.000 --> 19:36.250
Ai's god must've done this. I knew it would.

19:37.420 --> 19:38.710
It's this powerful?!

19:39.540 --> 19:46.630
How can we even contend… with something like this?!

19:48.080 --> 19:48.960
I can use this.

19:50.460 --> 19:52.830
We'll just have to get even with it.

19:53.330 --> 19:56.000
Is that so? And how are you going to do that?

20:06.420 --> 20:09.670
Weaklings in numbers are just that: weaklings.

20:09.790 --> 20:14.000
They couldn't lay a scratch on me,
and this isn't even my true form.

20:14.330 --> 20:17.460
What were you trying to do with them?

20:17.960 --> 20:19.290
What can they do to me?

20:20.830 --> 20:23.130
I'll tell you: nothing.

20:27.460 --> 20:30.420
The spirits here are just preschoolers.

20:30.830 --> 20:32.670
My graduates are elsewhere.

20:33.830 --> 20:36.630
But I don't need them to take you on.

20:36.920 --> 20:41.250
Oh? You think you would even be a challenge?

20:41.790 --> 20:43.630
I know I would beat you.

20:44.790 --> 20:48.420
You must be at least five hundred years old.

20:49.080 --> 20:53.210
And you're going to 'marry' her at twenty?

20:53.630 --> 20:56.920
I'm not going to let some god
and his problematic age gap beat me.

20:59.960 --> 21:04.460
I prefer my women with larger busts,
but you've forced my hand.

21:05.580 --> 21:06.380
Come, then.

21:06.790 --> 21:08.130
I'll be waiting.

21:08.670 --> 21:12.790
And when the time comes, I will take you instead.

21:13.460 --> 21:15.670
Entertain me, why don't you?!

21:16.920 --> 21:21.130
I-I-I'm not gonna let you lay a finger on my students!

21:22.670 --> 21:23.710
Keitaro...

21:29.670 --> 21:34.830
They're not shaking in fear.
They're shaking from how badly they want to kill it.

21:37.040 --> 21:38.080
We'll protect Ai.

21:39.290 --> 21:40.710
We'll protect everyone.

21:41.880 --> 21:47.580
We will prepare a throne suitable for your divinity,
from which you will serve us all.

23:22.460 --> 23:27.000
Yayoi and Keitaro challenge a god.

23:28.460 --> 23:34.630
While the divinity rages,
the spirits around her experience a drastic change,

23:35.290 --> 23:40.080
and Yayoi puts together her biggest scheme yet.
